{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What if solving a murder meant diving into the killer\u2019s mind?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Project Enceladus</i>, a first-person sci-fi puzzle platformer, you play as <strong>Detective Darren</strong>, tasked with uncovering the truth behind a brutal massacre aboard a deep-space research station.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To do that, you\u2019ll enter the mind of the man responsible \u2014 scientist Dr. Noah Valen \u2014 and explore his fractured psyche through a simulated reality constructed from memories, fears, and hidden truths.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inside this simulation, nothing behaves as expected. Physics bends, logic warps, and the line between memory and invention blurs.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Psychological Sci-Fi Mystery</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Investigate the sealed mind of a murderer using experimental simulation tech.<br>Your job isn\u2019t just to observe \u2014 it's to interact, question, and uncover. But be warned: the simulation reacts to you. It evolves. And not everything wants to be found.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore <strong>recorded memories</strong>, <strong>redacted logs</strong>, and <strong>environmental clues</strong> to reconstruct a hidden narrative that spans both the real and simulated worlds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3522860/extras/e64e1dd55e925691926e1614bd83d725.poster.avif?t=1769107768\" width=1062 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3522860/extras/e64e1dd55e925691926e1614bd83d725.webm?t=1769107768\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3522860/extras/e64e1dd55e925691926e1614bd83d725.mp4?t=1769107768\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Telekinetic Puzzle Solving</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your most powerful tool? A <strong>remote manipulation energy</strong> provided by simulation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab, move, rotate, and stack objects with precision \u2014 at range.<br>Solve puzzles by guiding energy cubes, redirecting power, and aligning components without touching a thing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3522860/extras/40c10350d8669c8475cba77b6982e1da.poster.avif?t=1769107768\" width=1062 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3522860/extras/40c10350d8669c8475cba77b6982e1da.webm?t=1769107768\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3522860/extras/40c10350d8669c8475cba77b6982e1da.mp4?t=1769107768\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Perception-Based Logic Challenges</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From switch puzzles to multi-state logic rooms, the game challenges you to think in systems.<br>You\u2019ll route energy, control logic gates, activate hidden conditions \u2014 sometimes remotely, sometimes under pressure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some puzzles ask you to <i>solve</i>. Others ask you to <i>observe</i>.<br>The solution may not be in front of you \u2014 but above, behind, or hidden in plain sight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3522860/extras/968e1e8b2a162c992d130bdf4dbf0c88.poster.avif?t=1769107768\" width=1062 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3522860/extras/968e1e8b2a162c992d130bdf4dbf0c88.webm?t=1769107768\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3522860/extras/968e1e8b2a162c992d130bdf4dbf0c88.mp4?t=1769107768\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Advanced Movement System</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate the simulation with agility and style using your traversal-enhanced suit:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dash</strong> past dangers or across collapsing floors</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Double jump</strong> for extended reach</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Climb and vault</strong> through vertical spaces</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traverse environments built around <strong>rhythm, physics and timing</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your movement matters. It\u2019s not just how you solve \u2014 it\u2019s <i>where</i> you can go next.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3522860/extras/02b61240773d1c232d064cb136b9639f.poster.avif?t=1769107768\" width=1062 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3522860/extras/02b61240773d1c232d064cb136b9639f.webm?t=1769107768\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3522860/extras/02b61240773d1c232d064cb136b9639f.mp4?t=1769107768\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Scan System \u2013 See What\u2019s Hidden</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your integrated <strong>Scan Pulse</strong> reveals what's not immediately visible.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Detect clues embedded in the walls</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Highlight interactive objects</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reveal hidden inputs or power lines</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Track connections across rooms</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover temperature zones</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some secrets simply won\u2019t show themselves without it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3522860/extras/8fed6f40edf462ab94f26f7c3c122d79.poster.avif?t=1769107768\" width=1062 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3522860/extras/8fed6f40edf462ab94f26f7c3c122d79.webm?t=1769107768\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3522860/extras/8fed6f40edf462ab94f26f7c3c122d79.mp4?t=1769107768\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Remote Drone Control</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your deployable drone gives you eyes and access where you can\u2019t follow.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fly through vents and maintenance shafts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trigger pressure pads or switches</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Observe puzzles from alternate angles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate hostile or unstable areas</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some rooms are designed for two \u2014 <strong>you and the drone</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3522860/extras/361c63739b1d856b68056bb0da530c71.poster.avif?t=1769107768\" width=1062 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3522860/extras/361c63739b1d856b68056bb0da530c71.webm?t=1769107768\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3522860/extras/361c63739b1d856b68056bb0da530c71.mp4?t=1769107768\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Narrative-Driven Puzzle Progression</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every puzzle is part of something larger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each is tied to a <strong>Clue Thread</strong> \u2014 a narrative arc in the mind of Dr. Noah Valen. <br> Some puzzles are required. Others are hidden, optional\u2026 and sometimes don\u2019t want to be found.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Optional challenge rooms represent <strong>Noah\u2019s subconscious</strong> \u2014 raw, unstable fragments of his mind. <br>Here, puzzles are symbolic, harder, and offer deeper insight into the truth he\u2019s trying to bury.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Surreal Sci-Fi Environments</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From sterile chambers to warped halls swallowed by shadow, no two areas look or feel alike.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Environments constructed from memories, emotion, and trauma</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lighting and architecture that tell the story without a word</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Areas that <i>change</i> as you complete objectives</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A sense of isolation, discovery \u2014 and wrongness \u2014 that builds constantly</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you progress deeper into the simulation, reality begins to fracture.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spaces twist, logic breaks, and the world around you becomes a reflection of a mind unraveling.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3522860/extras/5054c60b9a7476e2bc60f8373ed2c500.poster.avif?t=1769107768\" width=1062 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3522860/extras/5054c60b9a7476e2bc60f8373ed2c500.webm?t=1769107768\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3522860/extras/5054c60b9a7476e2bc60f8373ed2c500.mp4?t=1769107768\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3522860?t=1769107768","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3522860/21ca7a56b0bb1d819644a99db0175f2204876ee3/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1769107768","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3522860/0c11d8ccb3ae08b15aaa3d71e6a4665a471e5529/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769107768","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3522860/0c11d8ccb3ae08b15aaa3d71e6a4665a471e5529/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1769107768","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Adjustable Text Size","id":64},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Subtitle Options","id":65},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"This game contains themes of crime and murder, but no direct depictions of extreme violence. Some scenes may feature blood or brief flashbacks related to past events. The overall atmosphere is dark and suspenseful, with psychological thriller elements."},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What if solving a murder meant diving into the killer\u2019s mind?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Project Enceladus</i>, a first-person sci-fi puzzle platformer, you play as <strong>Detectiv