rature zones</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some secrets simply won\u2019t show themselves without it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3522860/extras/8fed6f40edf462ab94f26f7c3c122d79.poster.avif?t=1769107768\" width=1062 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3522860/extras/8fed6f40edf462ab94f26f7c3c122d79.webm?t=1769107768\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3522860/extras/8fed6f40edf462ab94f26f7c3c122d79.mp4?t=1769107768\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Remote Drone Control</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your deployable drone gives you eyes and access where you can\u2019t follow.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fly through vents and maintenance shafts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trigger pressure pads or switches</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Observe puzzles from alternate angles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate hostile or unstable areas</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some rooms are designed for two \u2014 <strong>you and the drone</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3522860/extras/361c63739b1d856b68056bb0da530c71.poster.avif?t=1769107768\" width=1062 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3522860/extras/361c63739b1d856b68056bb0da530c71.webm?t=1769107768\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3522860/extras/361c63739b1d856b68056bb0da530c71.mp4?t=1769107768\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Narrative-Driven Puzzle Progression</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every puzzle is part of something larger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each is tied to a <strong>Clue Thread</strong> \u2014 a narrative arc in the mind of Dr. Noah Valen. <br> Some puzzles are required. Others are hidden, optional\u2026 and sometimes don\u2019t want to be found.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Optional challenge rooms represent <strong>Noah\u2019s subconscious</strong> \u2014 raw, unstable fragments of his mind. <br>Here, puzzles are symbolic, harder, and offer deeper insight into the truth he\u2019s trying to bury.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Surreal Sci-Fi Environments</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From sterile chambers to warped halls swallowed by shadow, no two areas look or feel alike.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Environments constructed from memories, emotion, and trauma</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lighting and architecture that tell the story without a word</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Areas that <i>change</i> as you complete objectives</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A sense of isolation, discovery \u2014 and wrongness \u2014 that builds constantly</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you progress deeper into the simulation, reality begins to fracture.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spaces twist, logic breaks, and the world around you becomes a reflection of a mind unraveling.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3522860/extras/5054c60b9a7476e2bc60f8373ed2c500.poster.avif?t=1769107768\" width=1062 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3522860/extras/5054c60b9a7476e2bc60f8373ed2c500.webm?t=1769107768\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3522860/extras/5054c60b9a7476e2bc60f8373ed2c500.mp4?t=1769107768\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","developers":["Tam\u00e1s F\u00fcl\u00f6p","D\u00e1vid Guci","Zolt\u00e1n Farag\u00f3"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3522860/d698803affe5e71c13e3f59d5f435d97699c59fc/header.jpg?t=1769107768","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3522860/1231281589/9f03ecb4a6d8dee465053767b15b55ce37108dfa/1767003646/dash_av1.mpd?t=1767011170","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3522860/1231281589/9f03ecb4a6d8dee465053767b15b55ce37108dfa/1767003646/dash_h264.mpd?t=1767011170","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3522860/1231281589/9f03ecb4a6d8dee465053767b15b55ce37108dfa/1767003646/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1767011170","id":257100110,"name":"Project Enceladus Teaser","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257100110/fc43eabdc7062e0b506c442804fbe7e22f7c62dd/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1767011170"}],"name":"Project Enceladus","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> AMD Ryzen 5 3600 vagy Intel Core i5-9600K<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA RTX 2060<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 30 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> DirectX kompatibilis<br></li><li><strong>VR Support:</strong> Nem</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><str